# Operator Guide -- Infinite Room Labs Homelab

## Quick Reference

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Check all services | `/usr/local/bin/irl-health-check` |
| View running containers | `docker ps --format 'table {{ '{{' }}.Names{{ '}}' }}\t{{ '{{' }}.Status{{ '}}' }}\t{{ '{{' }}.Ports{{ '}}' }}'` |
| View compose stack | `cd {{ irl_compose_base }}/{stack} && docker compose ps` |
| Restart a stack | `cd {{ irl_compose_base }}/{stack} && docker compose restart` |
| View logs | `cd {{ irl_compose_base }}/{stack} && docker compose logs -f --tail=100` |
| ZFS pool status | `sudo zpool status {{ irl_zfs_pool }}` |
| ZFS snapshots | `sudo zfs list -t snapshot` |
| Firewall rules | `sudo nft list ruleset` |
| Tailscale status | `tailscale status` |

