## SOPs

### Deploy a New Service
1. Add compose template in `ansible/templates/compose/{stack}/`
2. Add playbook in `ansible/playbooks/`
3. Add to `ansible/site.yml`
4. Run: `./ansible/run-ansible.sh playbook playbooks/{new-service}.yml`

### Restart a Service
```bash
cd {{ irl_compose_base }}/{stack}
sudo docker compose restart {service}
```

### Check Disk Usage
```bash
df -h /
sudo zfs list
sudo zpool list
```

